        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "Imagine transferring $2 to the other participant. What do you find it similar to? Can you give an example of a real-world situation that is similar to this outcome? The situation can involve two people or groups. It can be an experience you or somebody you know lived, or it could be fictional.",
