        "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n\nvar endowment = 12\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('endowment', endowment)\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('open_first', 1)\n\n/* Bottom Left Slider */\n\n document.getElementById(\"bottomleftSlider\").oninput = function() {\n\t writeValuebottomleft();\n    getValuebottomleft();\n\tjQuery(\"#NextButton\").show();\n };\n\nfunction writeValuebottomleft() {\n   document.getElementById(\"bottomleftSlider\").className = \"slider_click\"\n   var val = document.getElementById(\"bottomleftSlider\").value //get the oninput value\n   document.getElementById('output3').innerHTML =\"$\"+ val //display this value to the html page\n}\n\n\nfunction getValuebottomleft() {\n   var val = parseFloat(document.getElementById(\"bottomleftSlider\").value); //get the oninput value\n   Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('allocation', 12+val)\n   Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData('transfer', -val)\t\n}\n\n\t\n});",
        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Please choose your transfer to the other participant.</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<table style=\"margin-left: auto; \n  margin-right: auto;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<table id=\"${e://Field/color_1}\">\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" step=\"0.5\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" list=\"tickmarks\" id=\"bottomleftSlider\" class=\"slider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<center><b>Your transfer: <b><span id=\"output3\"> Click on the slider </span></b></b></center>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b> </b></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><br></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>",
