    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_0ewMTJiHU55h1AO",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID156",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Data Price - Instructions In this task, you are matched with another Prolific participant. You wi...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<b>Data Price - Instructions</b><br>\n<br>\n<span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">In this task, you are matched with another Prolific participant. You will never know the identity of the person with whom you are paired, and this person will never know your identity.</span><br>\nYou take the role of&nbsp;<b>data provider (producer)</b>, and the other participant takes the role of&nbsp;<b>broker (intermediary)</b>. As a data provider, you produce survey data through online questionnaires like the one you are in. A computer will randomly determine an <b>initial price</b> for your data.<br>\nYou will then have the opportunity to <b>adjust this price</b> before it is sent to the broker.<br><br>\nThe broker will sell your data to the research team for a fixed price of $12. You will receive the final price you set.<br>\nYour decision affects a bonus payment. Specifically, 1 in 10 participant pairs will be randomly selected, and for those selected:\n<ul data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2936\">\n\t<li>The&nbsp;<b>data provider</b>&nbsp;(you) receives a bonus payment equal to the final price you set.</li>\n\t<li>The&nbsp;<b>broker</b>&nbsp;receives $12 from the research team for the sold data and pays the provider the set price, keeping the difference.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\nWe will also ask you some open-ended questions. Your answers to these questions are completely anonymous and do not affect your earnings, but <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">it is <b>crucial for our study</b> that you answer each question <b>truthfully </b>and <b>carefully</b></span>.<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Data Price - Instructions In this task, you are matched with another Prolific participant. You wi...",
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "GradingData": [],
        "Language": [],
        "NextChoiceId": 9,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "DisplayLogic": {
          "0": {
            "0": {
              "ChoiceLocator": "q://QID154/SelectableChoice/1",
              "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">This question concerns the following problem: Often, participants click through surveys like this one without reading the instructions carefully. As a consequence, many of the participants can't be...</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Very interested</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected</span> ",
              "LeftOperand": "q://QID154/SelectableChoice/1",
              "LogicType": "Question",
              "Operator": "Selected",
              "QuestionID": "QID154",
              "QuestionIDFromLocator": "QID154",
              "QuestionIsInLoop": "no",
              "Type": "Expression"
            },
            "1": {
              "ChoiceLocator": "q://QID154/SelectableChoice/4",
              "Conjuction": "And",
              "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">And</span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">This question concerns the following problem: Often, participants click through surveys like this one without reading the instructions carefully. As a consequence, many of the participants can't be...</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I've never heard of it</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected</span> ",
              "LeftOperand": "q://QID154/SelectableChoice/4",
              "LogicType": "Question",
              "Operator": "Selected",
              "QuestionID": "QID154",
              "QuestionIDFromLocator": "QID154",
              "QuestionIsInLoop": "no",
              "Type": "Expression"
            },
            "Type": "If"
          },
          "Type": "BooleanExpression",
          "inPage": false
        },
        "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<b>Data Price - Instructions</b><br>\n<br>\n<span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">In this task, you are matched with another Prolific participant. You will never know the identity of the person with whom you are paired, and this person will never know your identity.</span><br>\nYou take the role of&nbsp;<b>data provider (producer)</b>, and the other participant takes the role of&nbsp;<b>broker (intermediary)</b>. As a data provider, you produce survey data through online questionnaires like the one you are in. A computer will randomly determine an <b>initial price</b> for your data.<br>\nYou will then have the opportunity to <b>adjust this price</b> before it is sent to the broker.<br><br>\nThe broker will sell your data to the research team for a fixed price of $12. You will receive the final price you set.<br>\nYour decision affects a bonus payment. Specifically, 1 in 10 participant pairs will be randomly selected, and for those selected:\n<ul data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2936\">\n\t<li>The&nbsp;<b>data provider</b>&nbsp;(you) receives a bonus payment equal to the final price you set.</li>\n\t<li>The&nbsp;<b>broker</b>&nbsp;receives $12 from the research team for the sold data and pays the provider the set price, keeping the difference.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\nWe will also ask you some open-ended questions. Your answers to these questions are completely anonymous and do not affect your earnings, but <span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">it is <b>crucial for our study</b> that you answer each question <b>truthfully </b>and <b>carefully</b></span>.<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;",
        "DataExportTag": "Q156",
        "QuestionID": "QID156"
      }
    },
