      "SecondaryAttribute": "You were provisionally allocated $8. The other participant was provisionally allocated $4.   We n..",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">You were provisionally allocated <b>$8</b>. The other participant was provisionally allocated <b>$4</b>.</span><br>\n&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">We now present three hypothetical final allocations of the task you carried out. We ask you to describe a real-world situation you find each similar to. The situation can involve two people or groups. It can be an experience you or somebody you know lived, or it could be fictional. Remember that the task was:\n<br><br>You have the option to make a transfer to the other participant. You can transfer any amount between $0 and $8.<br><br>The hypothetical allocations are:</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q61",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
